<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuania May CPI 0.8 pct mo/mo, 7.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Lithuania May CPI 0.8 pct mo/mo, 7.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian consumer prices rose by a monthly 0.8 percent in May for a year-on-year inflation rate of 7.9 percent, the statistics department said on Friday.</p>
<p>    LITHUANIAN CPI		   May 97   April 97    May 96</p>
<p>    Month-on month change (pct)  0.8	0.3	   0.3</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change (pct)    7.9	7.3	  28.8</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom, + 370 22 35 17</p>
